  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "m12-counter",
      "path": "app/",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "input[name=\"business\"][value=\"corner_shop\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button[type=\"submit\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "input[name=\"market\"][value=\"BD\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button[type=\"submit\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "selector": "input[name=\"shopName\"]",
          "value": "Rahman Store"
        },
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "selector": "input[name=\"phone\"]",
          "value": "01712345482"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button[type=\"submit\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "selector": ".app-shell"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": ".app-sidebar nav a[href$=\"/counter\"]:visible,.app-bottom-nav a[href$=\"/counter\"]:visible"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "selector": ".counter-page[aria-busy=\"false\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "selector": "input[name=\"calculation\"]",
          "value": "75+150+20"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": ".counter-given button:text-is(\"৳500\")"
        }
      ],
      "note": "Real local counter and receipts. Use C01 keypad/type/spacing and C03 receipt geometry; dynamic totals and a genuine text QR replace reference examples. The desktop layout adapts the phone counter with the existing 240px shell and a sales log beside it. C00 supplies the day-total/list card primitives for the log, not its later orders, credit or stock data. Touch targets are at least 44px; future customer registration, khata and online tracking are absent. Capture-only navigation positioning prevents the fixed bar covering long content. Skip links are hidden only for capture, as on the landing report.",
      "captureStyle": ".app-shell{position:relative}.app-bottom-nav{position:absolute}.app-skip{visibility:hidden}",
      "sections": [
        {
          "id": "screen",
          "selector": ".app-shell",
